{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8204b92dfda86a67b3f21f55d5a2920d5d6e7c6e1cdb6506268268a8f1259660","ja":"ふう……外の撮影、晴れて良かったけど、\nちょっと暑いね、風花さん。","zh":"呼……外景拍摄虽然放晴了挺好，\n但稍微有点热呢，风花小姐。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8d0ff0b8d625c657e16e63cc871101c1dc98e6834aafe2208068b22e674ee377","ja":"そうね。用意してきてよかった……\nよい、しょっと。","zh":"确实呢。幸好提前准备好了……\n一、二，嘿咻。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ff14a292f4ba765a47c0aba45885c42bb2d75f8ee8939228b016eedd19d386dd","ja":"さっきから気になってたんだけど、\nそのクーラーボックス、どうしたの？","zh":"我从刚才开始就在意了，\n那个保温箱是怎么回事？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"990d603c38dfb3e485f8cadbdd91c335f0e74a91e26e0f9f85c3357322c017d0","ja":"熱中症対策の経口補水液やタブレットだよ！\nはいこれ、桃子ちゃんの分ね。","zh":"这是用来防中暑的口服补液盐和含片哦！\n来，这包是桃子你的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2de3a7e4965b463661966fb1513450aa2e840c57b18a4acfe0291dcdfbe1cb8d","ja":"えっ！？　わざわざみんなの分を持ってきたの！？","zh":"咦！？还特地给大家都带了一份吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3613a0cbe25af4ef65df0f2e8d89f107c6672515206bad0d3dbd64161ab191cc","ja":"ええ。スタッフさんと共演者のみなさんの分、\nちゃんと用意してあるわよ！","zh":"嗯。工作人员和共演者各位的份，\n我都好好准备好了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7ec6e86eb1a3f5af767777f15f5a3a6895f941adff50899f011196b49ba43045","ja":"それって、すごい量なんじゃないの？","zh":"那不是很多吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5cd6a83bc52a6e1d033781f9bb1fda3e1b8895870339ce756d21331e4a6ddd60","ja":"ちょっと大変だったけど、\n今日は暑いしよく動くから、補給はこまめにね。","zh":"虽然有点辛苦，\n不过今天很热，活动量也大，要记得勤补水哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4b057f73e4735e7439fbcbc9430cb285b3447ffb5875bc719bc34643f0c10514","ja":"ミネラルを補給するためにも、タブレットも\nこまめに食べること！　いい、桃子ちゃん！！","zh":"为了补充矿物质，也要经常吃营养片！\n听好了，桃子！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2c845b07b6a06f4289659d4c093ade37334205918a68fb07c079e48ea5e7772e","ja":"う、うん。わかった。ありがとう、風花さん。","zh":"嗯、嗯。我知道了。谢谢你，风花。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6939fa71c85191f6b6577f52c830ca546122950de670f232a3cbd5b936a2d880","ja":"よしっ。みんなの体調管理を\n厳しく指導できたわね！","zh":"好嘞。大家的身体状况管理\n严格地指导过了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"07fa57912475cb3f48552f1cde0d1d802d0d8cecff568c6c2ca4b8022bd0a629","ja":"この調子で『人に厳しく週間』頑張らなきゃ！\nじゃあ桃子ちゃん、私、他の人にも配ってくるね♪","zh":"照这个势头，『对人严格周』也得加油才行！\n那么桃子，我去发给其他人啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"abec42e48b88a5af92b549df711c5a3d185761b0e8a75246de41f80c47dcfa37","ja":"あ、うん……。\n……て、えっ？　『人に厳しく週間』……？","zh":"啊，嗯……。\n……咦，什么？『对人严格周』……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1410.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9af4112f0e9e7f44beba640b61647f67c70875dc1d98ff137b7af67236556477","ja":"さっきのって、厳しくしてたのかな？　桃子の\n体調を気にしてくれただけだと思うんだけど……？","zh":"刚才那个，是不是太严厉了？我觉得只是担心桃子的身体状况而已……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
